Package: ptdensity
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Multiscale Density Estimation with Hidden Markov Polya Trees
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Naoki", "Awaya", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "nawaya@waseda.jp")
Description: Bayesian estimation of multivariate densities using hidden
    Markov Polya trees with adaptive partitions, following Awaya and Ma
    (2024) <doi:10.1080/01621459.2022.2105223>. Latent states on the tree
    nodes allow the smoothness of the density to vary across the sample
    space, as in the adaptive Polya tree of Ma (2017)
    <doi:10.1214/16-BA1021>. Provides the posterior mean density, draws from
    the predictive distribution, exact one- and two-variable marginal
    densities, and a representative partition tree. Posterior computation
    combines sequential Monte Carlo and recursive message passing.
URL: https://github.com/nawaya040/ptdensity
BugReports: https://github.com/nawaya040/ptdensity/issues
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
